> The original business began not long after the end of World War 2 with the importation of High Performance anchors and ancillary products from predominantly the UK. Stock carrying branches were established in all the main centers of South Africa with competent sales personnel at each branch servicing the construction, mining, utility, petrochemical and general hardware industries in South Africa.
